ue pelota, having won 13 world titles between 1952 and 1982, of which nine in the paleta goma. He would also compete in that event in Mexico placing second as well."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/901891"} "Jorge Loaiza"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/901886"} "José Luis Hernández"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/901903"} "Roberto Sanciprián"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MEX"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/MEX.png"}] "MEX"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/900926"} "Aarón Sehter"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/900927"} "Jorge Utge"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ARG"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ARG.png"}] "ARG"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/901273"} "Federico Garraus"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/901284"} "Juan José Lersundi"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/901280"} "Miguel Irigaray"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ESP"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ESP.png"}] "ESP"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/902248"} "Hermán Sánchez"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/902244"} "Hugo Germone"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URU"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URU.png"}] "URU"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/901428"} "Étienne Hirigoyen"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/901437